Interview Questions
What is Pydantic?

A validation library used by FastAPI to validate and serialize data.

Why use Pydantic?
Validation
Serialization
Automatic documentation
Type safety
What is a Request Body?

Data sent by the client in a POST/PUT request.

What happens when validation fails?

FastAPI returns:

422 Unprocessable Entity
What is a Response Model?

A model that controls what fields are returned to the client.

